        "original_id": "f4d30537-37c2-511c-89ff-a640cc2e9ff8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Countries: Russia, United Kingdom\n- Events: World War I, World War II, Cold War, Russian Revolution, February Revolution\n- People: Nicholas II\n- Governments: Russian Empire, Provisional Government\n\nFacts:\n- During the February Revolution of 1917, the Russian Empire collapsed after Emperor Nicholas II abdicated.\n- During the February Revolution of 1917, the old regime in Russia was replaced by a provisional government.\n- Russia and the United Kingdom were allies in World War I, but their relations were strained by the Russian Revolution of 1917.\n- Russia and the United Kingdom were allies again in World War II.\n- Russia and the United Kingdom were hostile adversaries during the Cold War from 1947 to 1991.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
